   "cooked": "<p>This period covers praise given between <strong>28 November 2021</strong> and <strong>26 December 2021</strong>. We allocated <strong>4154 TEC</strong> tokens for rewards, with a <strong>100:0</strong> split between Praise and Sourcecred. Some praise accounts still haven’t been activated so the total amount below will be less than what we set aside to distribute.</p>\n<p>Out of the total rewards:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>90% of the tokens were given as praise rewards <img alt=\":pray:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/pray.png?v=10\" title=\":pray:\"/>\n</li>\n<li>7% distributed among quantifiers <img alt=\":balance_scale:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/balance_scale.png?v=10\" title=\":balance_scale:\"/>\n</li>\n<li>3% assigned to the reward board <img alt=\":memo:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/memo.png?v=10\" title=\":memo:\"/>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This data has been reviewed by the Quantifiers and the Reward Board, and has been submitted for distribution to the <a href=\"https://xdai.aragon.blossom.software/#/rewardboardtec/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Reward Board DAO</a></p>\n<p>You can check out the <a href=\"https://rawcdn.githack.com/CommonsBuild/tec-rewards/c2eba98a9f6f09993ae69936db2d9485e72f7c48/distribution_rounds/round-6/distribution_results/reports/round-6_general_RAD_report_Report.html\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"><strong>full period analysis here</strong></a>. <img alt=\":bar_chart:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/bar_chart.png?v=10\" title=\":bar_chart:\"/></p>\n<p>This post will be open to the community for review for 48 hours then submitted to the Reward Board for final execution. <img alt=\":heavy_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/heavy_check_mark.png?v=10\" title=\":heavy_check_mark:\"/></p>\n<p>The Rewards Distribution for this round is as follows:</p>\n<div class=\"md-table\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Username</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:right\">Rewards in TEC</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">divine_comedian#5493</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">211.663</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">chuygarcia.eth#6692</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">195.902</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">Zeptimus#3359</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">193.737</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">griff (<img alt=\":purple_heart:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/purple_heart.png?v=10\" title=\":purple_heart:\"/>, <img alt=\":purple_heart:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/purple_heart.png?v=10\" title=\":purple_heart:\"/>)<span class=\"hashtag\">#8888</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">178.524</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">Tam2140#9361</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">165.578</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">liviade#1387</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">149.841</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">Nuggan#5183</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">149.121</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">sem(<img alt=\":cherry_blossom:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/cherry_blossom.png?v=10\" title=\":cherry_blossom:\"/>,<img alt=\":honeybee:\" class=\"emoji\" src=\"https://forum.tecommons.org/images/emoji/win10/honeybee.png?v=10\" title=\":honeybee:\"/>)<span class=\"hashtag\">#0161</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">146.856</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">Juankbell#7458</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">141.821</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">Vyvy-vi#5040</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">120.174</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">natesuits#4789</td>\n<td style=